  "acceptance": {
    "shared": "346 functions per platform: Core 179, Persistence 145, Speech 7, app model 15. Dynamic cases are not counted as additional functions.",
    "cancellation": "Both form and parent cancellation reach the authentication task. Noncooperative old results cannot publish credentials or release a newer request. App-owned cache reads may finish for another scene; the cancelled form cannot commit credentials, replace its visible account or send work.",
    "transport": "Explicit server GET authentication, origin/port/path response boundaries, invalid base URLs, cross-server pagination, account hibernation and definite rejected-write behavior are covered. A hibernating review write remains unauthorized and is attempted only once.",
    "ui": "Five native cases pass for sign-in, lessons, draft continuity, Home/search and queued links. Final sign-in acceptance additionally disconnects the in-memory account and reconnects from the signed-out root. The single-case final run overlaps the earlier five; it is not six distinct cases. iPhone/iPad each pass token errors/hibernation/logout, keyboard submission and read-only reconnection context.",
    "retired_tests": "The two form-encoder functions and six password-scraper functions are intentionally retired with their deleted behavior. All retained hosted/API tests execute; the removed live prober was not run against an account.",
    "lock": "Xcode resolution confirms PMKFoundation is absent. Only its obsolete lock entry was removed; remaining selected versions/revisions are unchanged. Release builds use those same active pins."
  },
