  "initial_failures": [
    "Initial iOS/legacy builds failed before executing tests because DataTaskPromise was a global type alias declared in the removed WebClient file. Adding an import alone did not replace that alias. The final retained transport uses native URLSession, explicit response validation and its existing PromiseKit return contract; PMKFoundation is removed.",
    "The initial generic whole-file lint encountered preexisting legacy API DTO snake_case/documentation rules. The retained legacy client change is scoped and its changed transport is formatted; the shared/model/UI sources pass their full formatting check. No checker or rule is disabled."
  ],
  "retained_warnings": [
    "The expanded native bundle retains two internal thread-priority warnings. The final auth-only and mobile UI result bundles have no runtimeWarnings; no cause or global fix is claimed.",
    "The iOS release retains legacy protobuf/watch/deprecation warnings. Its count reflects the actual build, not a warning-reduction claim. Native Mac release reports zero build warnings.",
    "The earlier notes keyboard frame warning, launch-XCUITest discrepancy and physical input/audio gates remain separate open investigations."
  ],
